      ],
      "content": "SP 90 NE     CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST. LENOARDS      HAWRIDGE                                               (south west side) 3/73                                               Cottage at Hawridge -                                             Court GV                                            II                                            Former outbuilding converted to service cottage.  C16 altered.  Timber frame with brick ground floor and infill, some in old narrow bricks. Old tile roof.  2-storeys.  Modern windows.  Early C19 trellis porch of 'gothick\" pattern against west wall.  Interior: altered but has large floor beams including dragon beam to north east corner.  Large chimney stack near western end.  Stands within ancient moated site together with altered C18 farmhouse and may be a fragment of the earlier house, adapted and possibly moved to be used as a granary. RCHM I p 191 MON 2 Listing NGR: SP9501605846"
    }
